{"id":50177,"date":"2026-03-28T06:02:56","date_gmt":"2026-03-28T05:02:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/miut-madeira-island-ultra-trail\/"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:56:18","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:56:18","slug":"madeira-ultra-trail-miut","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/madeira-ultra-trail-miut\/","title":{"rendered":"Madeira Island Ultra-Trail \u2013 MIUT 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Madeira Island Ultra-Trail \u2013 MIUT 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Madeira Island Ultra-Trail \u2013 MIUT 2027<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong>24 e 25 de Abril de 2027<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado e Domingo) na <strong>Ilha da Madeira<\/strong>, tendo o <strong>F\u00f3rum Machico<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Machico<\/strong>, como centro nevr\u00e1lgico de meta para todas as dist\u00e2ncias, secretariado e MIUT EXPO. Integrado no prestigiado circuito mundial <strong>World Trail Majors<\/strong>, o evento desafia cerca de 3.800 atletas numa travessia \u00e9pica de noroeste a sudeste da ilha.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027 compreende cinco provas lineares non-stop: o m\u00edtico <strong>MIUT Legend (110 km com 7200m D+<\/strong>, partida \u00e0s 00:00 de 24 de abril em <strong>Porto Moniz<\/strong>), o <strong>MIUT Advanced (80 km com 4760m D+<\/strong>, \u00e0s 07:00 em <strong>S\u00e3o Vicente<\/strong>), o <strong>MIUT Discover (56 km com 2800m D+<\/strong>, \u00e0s 09:00 em <strong>Boaventura<\/strong>), o <strong>MIUT Marathon (40 km com 1450m D+<\/strong>, \u00e0s 11:00 no <strong>Monte, Funchal<\/strong>) e o <strong>MIUT Starter (17 km com 510m D+<\/strong>, a 25 de abril \u00e0s 08:00 no <strong>Porto da Cruz<\/strong>). Os percursos cruzam a floresta Laurissilva (Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO), o maci\u00e7o central montanhoso pelo Curral das Freiras, Pico Ruivo e Pico do Areeiro, e as veredas costeiras at\u00e9 \u00e0 ba\u00eda de Machico.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>Clube de Montanha do Funchal (CMOF)<\/strong>, o evento assegura transporte oficial de autocarro a partir de Machico e do Funchal para as partidas, servi\u00e7o de sacos de muda de roupa (drop bags no Curral das Freiras e na meta), abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica de resgate em montanha, seguro desportivo, brinde oficial e medalha finisher.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">24 a 25 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Machico, Ilha da Madeira<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">1