display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">MIUT Starter (Porto da Cruz \u2192 Machico)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 de Abril de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00 \u2022 510m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 40,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 55,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/12\/2026 a 15\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Madeira Island Ultra-Trail \u2013 MIUT 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O MIUT 2027 realiza-se nos dias 24 e 25 de abril de 2027 na Ilha da Madeira, com chegada de todas as provas, secretariado e MIUT EXPO no F\u00f3rum Machico (concelho de Machico).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, locais e hor\u00e1rios de partida do MIUT 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado, 24 de abril, partem o MIUT Legend 110 km (7200m D+ | 00:00 em Porto Moniz), o MIUT Advanced 80 km (4760m D+ | 07:00 em S\u00e3o Vicente), o MIUT Discover 56 km (2800m D+ | 09:00 em Boaventura) e o MIUT Marathon 40 km (1450m D+ | 11:00 no Monte, Funchal). No domingo, 25 de abril, parte o MIUT Starter 17 km (510m D+ | 08:00 no Porto da Cruz).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do MIUT 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As taxas de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dividem-se em duas fases (1\u00aa fase at\u00e9 30\/11\/2026 e 2\u00aa fase de 01\/12\/2026 a 15\/03\/2027): MIUT Legend 110 km (180\u20ac \/ 195\u20ac), MIUT Advanced 80 km (140\u20ac \/ 160\u20ac), MIUT Discover 56 km (110\u20ac \/ 120\u20ac), MIUT Marathon 40 km (90\u20ac \/ 100\u20ac) e MIUT Starter 17 km (40\u20ac \/ 55\u20ac).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os requisitos ITRA e tempos limite de cada prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O MIUT Legend (limite 32h) exige m\u00ednimo de 4 pontos ITRA (ou 115 km-esfor\u00e7o); o MIUT Advanced (limite 25h) exige 2 pontos ITRA (ou 45 km-esfor\u00e7o); e o MIUT Discover (limite 15h) exige 1 ponto ITRA (ou 25 km-esfor\u00e7o). As provas MIUT Marathon (limite 11h) e MIUT Starter (limite 3h30) est\u00e3o isentas de pontos qualificativos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios funciona o secretariado (Check-In) e os autocarros?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado (Check-In) funciona no F\u00f3rum Machico nos dias 21 e 22 de abril (13:00\u201321:00), 23 de abril (10:00\u201322:00) e 24 de abril (09:00\u201312:00). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui transporte oficial de autocarro a partir de Machico e do Funchal para os locais de partida e servi\u00e7o de sacos de muda de roupa (Drop Bags).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEven